            SimplifiedChineseLanguagePackPlugin.Translate(SimplifiedChineseLanguagePackPlugin.GUID, null, "The unusual, unsorted, and unruly cards that have been added by mods but not properly sorted into packs.", "모드로 추가되었으나 팩으로 제대로 분류되지 않은 독특하고 뒤섞인 카드들.", Language.Korean);
